            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true'># Correct Predictions </run>
                <run>is a count of interview events where the interviewer gave a score of &apos;1- Strong Yes&apos;  to a candidate that later received a &apos;4 -&apos; or &apos;5-&apos; in the 2021 performance review. 

</run>
                <run bold='true'># Hires Interviewed </run>
                <run>is a count of hired employees with both interview rating and 2021 performance review logged.

</run>
                <run bold='true'>% Correct Predictions =</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true'># Correct Predictions / # Hires Interviewed</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>Avg. Tenure (Y) </run>
                <run>is the average length of service in years for hires in the selected group.

</run>
                <run bold='true'>Avg. TTP </run>
                <run>is the average time to promotion in years for hires in the selected group.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
