            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='9'>In each department, what proportion of hires were accurately predicted to be high performers (i.e. receiving both an interview rating of &apos;1 - Strong Yes&apos; and performance score of either &apos;4 - Exceeding&apos; or &apos;5 - Outstanding&apos;?</run>
