          <zone h='89600' id='7' type-v2='empty' w='3211' x='571' y='9600'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8800' id='10' type-v2='text' w='62571' x='19286' y='800'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='15'>Purpose &amp; Objectives</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='6' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='6' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d61f26' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8800' id='12' type-v2='text' w='8286' x='81857' y='800'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Last Updated:</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='5' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='6' />
              <format attr='margin-right' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='6' />
              <format attr='margin-left' value='0' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d61f26' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='3200' id='13' type-v2='empty' w='46218' x='3782' y='9600'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='39500' id='14' type-v2='text' w='92430' x='3782' y='12800'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Purpose</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>Thus far, recruiting performance has been measured using # interviews and # hires per month / quarter as well as &apos;time to&apos; KPIs. There has been little to no analysis done on quality of hires made. With recent performance and engagement data from 2021 loaded into AWS, we can start to benchmark basic quality of hire metrics. The primary focus will be comparing Interview Rating to Performance rating and determining whether there is any correlation.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>The scope of the dashboard includes employees who meet the following criteria:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>1) Received a performance review in July 2021</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>2) Received at least one interview rating logged in Workday</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>Employees who do not meet both these criteria are not considered.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>The dashboard was created at the request of recruiting leadership and C-Level. Only they will have direct access to the dashboard. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='35500' id='15' type-v2='text' w='92430' x='3782' y='52300'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Objectives</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>The dashboard was created to answer the following commonly asked questions:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>1. Is there a correlation between Interview Rating and Performance Rating for hired candidates? </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>2. How many candidates scored 1 - Strong Yes actually end up receiving a performance score of 4 or 5? </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>3. How do Interview Rating and Performance Rating compare by cost center?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>4. Do specific sources generate better candidates?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>5. Which recruiters / hiring managers / interviewers have the best judgment?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8600' id='24' type-v2='text' w='92430' x='3782' y='87800'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Created By: Deanna Dang</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>
Please direct all inquiries to the People Analytics JIRA</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='8800' id='29' is-scaled='1' param='Image/images.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='5572' x='571' y='800'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
